  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/pyjs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. @100b6fbb6e elixir.yaml/javascript.yaml carry no stdlib_modules/stdlib_prefixes; io_boundary.module_ecosystem unchanged. Fixture fx_hotut: fs.readFileSync chain dst_ecosystem None (axios.get third_party, Python builtins.open stdlib); fx_hotut2: elixir File.read!/Enum.map/:ets.new nodes carry no ecosystem/directness. New since filing: WI-tufob (2613b61e34, 2026-10-30) added js_package_entry.NODE_CORE_MODULES, a reader-local Node core list ADR-0041 s3 says must not be the source. Overlaps WI-biruk (all non-Python catalogues). MECHANISM: module_ecosystem returns None unless a catalogue enumerates stdlib_modules/prefixes; elixir.yaml/javascript.yaml enumerate none. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-biruk."  # 229c
